    <string name="prayer_hail_holy_queen">Arahaba ry Mpanjakavavy, Reny feno famindrampo,\nny fiainanay, ny hamamianay ary ny fanantenanay, arahaba!\nHianao no iantsoanay, zanak\'i Eva voaroaka;\nHianao no ialahelovanay, mitoloko sy mitomany ato amin\'ity lohasaha ity.\nAry noho izany, Mpanelanelana aminay,\nTodiho amintsika ny masonao feno famindrampo\nary aorian\'ity fanilihana ity, asehoy anay i Jesosy,\nvokatry ny kibonao voara-pitahy.\nRy mamindra fo, ry malala, ry Virjiny Maria mamy.\n\nMivavaha ho anay, ry Reniny masin\'Andriamanitra,\nmba hahatonga anay ho mendrika ny fampanantenan\'i Kristy.\nAmena.</string>
